{
  "name": "dsh-fpga-workbench",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "FPGA 开发模式 + 工具链设置:一个 DSH agent 预设(人设/工具/技能 + 本机工具链提示),外加「设置 → FPGA 开发模式」里配置 Vivado / ModelSim / QuestaSim / Verilator 与仿真库映射文件。",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./mode": "./lib/mode.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "presets",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node tools/check-all.mjs",
    "test:installed": "node tools/check-all.mjs --installed",
    "test:safety": "node tools/check-all.mjs --safety"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.2"
  },
  "comment": "schemastery 用 peerDependencies 而不是 dependencies:宿主注册 settings 命名空间需要 schema,而 profile 里本来就有这个包(DSH 自带),peer 声明既表达了要求、又不触发安装或改动锁文件。files 必须包含 presets —— 少了它,pnpm 打 file: 依赖时不会把预设拷进 profile,失败方式是静默的(模式从列表里消失);tools/check-installed.mjs 断言这条。",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": "^0.1.7-rc.2 || ^0.2.0-rc.1",
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.1.7-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.1": "compatible"
      }
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
